          {:type "heading" :text "1. Prices and delivery"}
          {:type "paragraph" :text "Prices shown on the website are the product prices in Ugandan shillings (UGX). They do not include delivery. The delivery fee is agreed with you by phone or WhatsApp after you place your order, and it is recorded before your order is dispatched."}
          {:type "heading" :text "2. Cancelling your order"}
          {:type "paragraph" :text "You may cancel your order at any time before it is dispatched, for example if you do not agree the delivery fee. Tell us by phone or WhatsApp. Once an order has been dispatched it can no longer be cancelled through the website."}
          {:type "heading" :text "3. Payment"}
          {:type "paragraph" :text "You pay when your order is delivered, in cash or by mobile money. Nothing is charged online."}
          {:type "heading" :text "4. Being reachable"}
          {:type "paragraph" :text "We contact you on the phone number you give when ordering to agree the delivery fee and arrange delivery. Please keep that phone available. We may be unable to deliver if we cannot reach you."}
          {:type "heading" :text "5. Returns"}
          {:type "paragraph" :text "Our returns rules are set out in the returns and refunds policy, which forms part of these terms."}
          {:type "heading" :text "6. Your personal data"}
          {:type "list" :items ["We use your name, phone number, address and optional email to process and deliver your order."
